{"strings": {"Assets/Content/Notes/Tenement Deekula B/Hiding SMV patients.asset": {"NoteInfo:addressableAssetPath": ["sharedassets9.assets"]}, "Hiding fungal disease patients": {"NoteInfo:title": ["sharedassets9.assets"]}, "There are rumors that some patients escaped from the quarantine area and they're now hiding with normal people. Some of them cover their faces with masks and and keep a low profile. There are some cases that are well known, but no one is completely sure if they really suffered from fungal disease or if there's some other reasons why they wear a mask.\n\nThey can also be patients who have managed to overcome the fungal disease completely, but their faces have suffered some cosmetic damage. They may also have suffered severe brain damage and I recommend to be careful near them because they can behave unpredictably.": {"NoteInfo:content": ["sharedassets9.assets"]}, "Assets/Content/Notes/Tenement Deekula B/Letter to Krista.asset": {"NoteInfo:addressableAssetPath": ["sharedassets9.assets"]}, "Letter to Krista": {"NoteInfo:title": ["sharedassets9.assets"]}, "Dear Krista,\n\nUnfortunately I have to stay on sick leave. I have read all your messages and I know that you're worried about things that has happened in Stalburg and especially here in Obenseuer. Sadly even I don't have answers to all this.\n\nI have heard about this \"other side\" and I have to investigate it more, before I can say anything about it. I assure you that everything happens according to the will of God.\n\nWe just have to be patient and pray.\n\n- Father Tobias": {"NoteInfo:content": ["sharedassets9.assets"]}, "Assets/Content/Notes/Tenement Deekula B/Letter to Priest.asset": {"NoteInfo:addressableAssetPath": ["sharedassets9.assets"]}, "Letter to Priest": {"NoteInfo:title": ["sharedassets9.assets"]}, "If you're reading this letter you are probably cured or at least doing better. I'm going to leave this letter here, because I don't know if I'm coming back. I gave you an experimental drug while you were unconscious. I'm sorry I did that without your permission, but it was my only way to try save you. I hope you are not angry with me.\n\nThank you for taking care of my father in his last moments.\n\n- The girl next door": {"NoteInfo:content": ["sharedassets9.assets"]}, "Assets/Content/Notes/Tenement Deekula B/Neighbour.asset": {"NoteInfo:addressableAssetPath": ["sharedassets9.assets"]}, "Neighbour": {"NoteInfo:title": ["sharedassets9.assets"]}, "My neighbour knows what happened to me and she promised to help me. She doesn't want to tell anyone her name, but she revealed to me that she was part of Stalburg Underground group. I have heard bad things about them, but she seems be completely different if those rumors are true. \n\nI know that I can trust her and I don't really have other choice, because she's my only hope to cure my sickness. I know that it's not going to be easy for her. \n\nI feel worse day by day. I can't leave from my aparment anymore. If someone would see me in this condition, they would move me to an isolated zone.\n \nOnly thing I can do is pray and hope that God is merciful to me. This pain inside is making me want to do things I would never think I would do. God forgive me.\n\n- Father Tobias": {"NoteInfo:content": ["sharedassets9.assets"]}, "Assets/Content/Notes/Tenement Deekula B/Osrat device.asset": {"NoteInfo:addressableAssetPath": ["sharedassets9.assets"]}, "Osrat device": {"NoteInfo:title": ["sharedassets9.assets"]}, "It looks like that Osrat can't get signals withouth the amulet. It's from the other side so it's probably still connected there on some level. It feels like something is pulling it to the other side. Maybe it's those red stones that causes it.\n\nBest places to get connection is near the dead bodies, but sometimes it doesn't seem to be true. It starts beeping when it has a strong connection and then you can try to travel to the other side. I just haven't been able to find a strong enough signal to get deeper than a state they call a \"black noise\". I probably need a bigger transmitter or a place that has a very strong connection if I want to get any further.": {"NoteInfo:content": ["sharedassets9.assets"]}, "Assets/Content/Notes/Tenement Deekula B/Relocation note B9.asset": {"NoteInfo:addressableAssetPath": ["sharedassets9.assets"]}, "Relocation note to Deekula B9 residents": {"NoteInfo:title": ["sharedassets9.assets"]}, "Dear Deekula B9 residents.\n\nThe authorities of the city of Stalburg has decided to relocate all the residents of the apartment B9 to a new location that will be announced when the transfer will take place. \n\nYou have one day to take your main items with you. Please, don't take more items than you can handle and be prepared to show your passports to the authorities. If you do not have the passport, you will be still relocated and the authorities will help you get your passport. The inclusion of all products of mushroom origin is prohibited. Contact the authorities for more information.\n\nThe reason for this transfer is due to overpopulation in the area, vacant space on the other side of Obenseuer district and ensuring safe and healthy housing for city residents.\n\nThank you for your understanding.\n\n- Authorities of the city of Stalburg and fungal disease treatment unit": {"NoteInfo:content": ["sharedassets9.assets"]}, "Ambience": {"Soundscape:loopSounds[].title": ["sharedassets9.assets"]}, "Radio": {"Soundscape:loopSounds[].title": ["sharedassets9.assets"]}, "Water": {"Soundscape:loopSounds[].title": ["sharedassets9.assets"]}, "Wood": {"Soundscape:randomSounds[].title": ["sharedassets9.assets"]}, "Screaming": {"Soundscape:randomSounds[].title": ["sharedassets9.assets"]}, "Random": {"Soundscape:randomSounds[].title": ["sharedassets9.assets"]}, "Random 2": {"Soundscape:randomSounds[].title": ["sharedassets9.assets"]}, "Lamp": {"Soundscape:loopSounds[].title": ["sharedassets9.assets"]}, "Server": {"Soundscape:loopSounds[].title": ["sharedassets9.assets"]}, "Computer": {"Soundscape:loopSounds[].title": ["sharedassets9.assets"]}, "Sever 2": {"Soundscape:loopSounds[].title": ["sharedassets9.assets"]}, "Assets/Content/TaskItems/Keys/Deekula B storage keys.asset": {"TaskItemGroup:addressableAssetPath": ["sharedassets9.assets"]}, "DeekulaBStorageKeys14": {"TaskItemGroup:id": ["sharedassets9.assets"]}, "Deekula B storage keys": {"TaskItemGroup:itemName": ["sharedassets9.assets"]}, "Keys to the Deekula B storage.": {"TaskItemGroup:itemDetails": ["sharedassets9.assets"]}, "Assets/Content/TaskItems/Keys/Deekula apartment B3 keys.asset": {"TaskItem:addressableAssetPath": ["sharedassets9.assets"]}, "Deekula apartment B3 keys": {"TaskItem:itemName": ["sharedassets9.assets"]}, "Keys to the Deekula apartment B3 and storage B3.": {"TaskItem:itemDetails": ["sharedassets9.assets"]}, "Prefabs/Items/": {"CollectibleRecipe:prefabPath": ["sharedassets9.assets"], "CollectibleRecipeBook:prefabPath": ["sharedassets9.assets"]}, "Glowing Apple Pie": {"CollectibleRecipe:recipe.name": ["sharedassets9.assets"]}, "Glowing Meat Pie": {"CollectibleRecipe:recipe.name": ["sharedassets9.assets"]}, "Glowing Vegetable Pie": {"CollectibleRecipe:recipe.name": ["sharedassets9.assets"]}, "soup": {"CollectibleRecipeBook:RecipeTag": ["sharedassets9.assets"]}, "Glowing Chicken Pizza": {"CollectibleRecipe:recipe.name": ["sharedassets9.assets"]}, "Glowing Beef Pizza": {"CollectibleRecipe:recipe.name": ["sharedassets9.assets"]}, "Glowing Minced Meat Pizza": {"CollectibleRecipe:recipe.name": ["sharedassets9.assets"]}, "Glowing Pork Pizza": {"CollectibleRecipe:recipe.name": ["sharedassets9.assets"]}}}